   "id": "shabbat.62a.17",
   "daf": "62a",
   "sentenceId": 16,
   "he": "וְלֹא בְּכוֹלֵיאָר וְלֹא בְּכוֹבֶלֶת. מַאי כּוֹלֵיאָר? אָמַר רַב: מַכְבַּנְתָּא. כּוֹבֶלֶת — אָמַר רַב: חוּמַרְתָּא דְפִילוֹן. וְכֵן אָמַר רַב אַסִּי: חוּמַרְתָּא דְפִילוֹן.",
   "en": "We learned in the mishna: «Nor with a kulyar, nor with a kovelet.» The Gemara asks: «What is» a «kulyar? Rav said: A brooch» with which a woman fastens the collar of her garment. «Kovelet: Rav said» that it is «a bundle of fragrant herbs [pilon]. And, similarly, Rav Asi said: A bundle of fragrant herbs.»"
  }
 ],
